  "steps": [
    "Tray. Preheat the oven to 425 °F (220 °C). Spread onions, peppers and chicken on a baking tray without overcrowding.",
    "Season. Sprinkle 1½ tbsp of the seasoning mix over and toss well. Drizzle with oil and bake 20 minutes.",
    "Cheese. Scatter the cheese over and bake 5 more minutes; broil 2–3 minutes for a bubbly top if you like.",
    "Sauce. Whisk mayo, sour cream, buttermilk, chipotle seasoning, lime juice, salt and garlic powder; adjust to taste.",
    "Serve. Sprinkle with cilantro, drizzle with sauce and serve with warm tortillas or rice."
  ],
